C:Assign T: RAM:
C:fujinet-load-resident DEVS:fujinet-disk.device fujinet-disk.device
C:FailAt 11
C:FMOUNTRESTORE >DH0:restore-invalid.result
C:Echo "RESTORE INVALID RC=$RC" >>DH0:restore-invalid.result
C:doslistdiag >DH0:restore-invalid-dos.result
C:FLS host:/amiga-e2e-complete/diskdevice-fmount-restore-invalid >NIL:
